5. Conclusion
This paper proposed MCBLT, an accurate and robust multicamera 3D detection and tracking framework, based on early multi-view aggregation, in environments monitored by static multi-camera systems. The proposed framework has impressive generalizability for diverse scenes and camera settings. It also has a powerful capability for long-term association to track objects in very long videos. As a result, MCBLT achieves SOTA on the AICity’24 dataset and the WildTrack dataset.
